      "role": "user",
      "content": "The casual one is okay, but it feels a bit too generic/safe. For the urban/inner-city demographic, we want the tone to feel more authentic to the local culture so they feel like we actually \"get\" them. Can you try another version of the casual one that uses more authentic, street-level slang or a more \"urban\" dialect? Something that sounds more like how people actually talk in those neighborhoods so the rapport feels real.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
